r later?\", \"oh no wait, that's the wrong one, I meant the, uh, the nanny one\"], [\"beacon repair half an hour later\", \"wrong one — the nanny one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0056\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to plan the next couple of months and I've completely lost track, so when is my Knysna thing again?\"], [\"Could you please tell me when my Knysna thing is?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0057\", \"v\": [[\"I think I've got a delivery coming for the bedding, so what day is the eiderdown on?\", \"Different thing, I'm tidying up my notes and don't need it anymore, so could you delete the Wambui note?\", \"Actually, you know what, don't bother with that, I'll leave it as it is.\", \"I want to look through some old pictures tonight, so can you pull up my photo albums?\", \"I've been trying to reflect on how things went recently, so what did I write last week in my journal?\", \"Hmm, it's mainly the rough days I want to think about, so can you narrow that down to anything about anxious?\"], [\"umm what day's the… the eiderdown on?\", \"oh and uh can you delete the Wambui note?\", \"actually no, don't bother, forget it\", \"ok um can you show me my… my photo albums?\", \"so what did I write, uh, last week in my journal?\", \"hmm can you just… narrow that to anything about anxious?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0058\", \"v\": [[\"wipe the whole vault\", \"chase task subtasks?\", \"restore pigeon task\"], [\"Could you please clear out my entire vault?\", \"Would you mind showing me the subtasks of the chase task?\", \"Could you please restore the pigeon task for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0059\", \"v\": [[\"list albums\", \"completed last week?\", \"just next week\", \"Zibocombe Meadows shots\", \"how many?\"], [\"Could you please list my albums?\", \"Would you tell me what I completed last week?\", \"Could you show me just the ones from next week, please?\", \"Could I see the shots from Zibocombe Meadows, please?\", \"And how many is that, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w33-0060\", \"v\": [[\"umm do I have any, like, Moseness expenses?\", \"oh hang on, quick one, what's Manon Holmberg's mobile number?\", \"ok back to the Moseness thing, um, is it in my paperwork as well?\"], [\"Could you tell me whether I have any Moseness expenses, please?\", \"Sorry, before I forget, could you give me Manon Holmberg's mobile number?\", \"Thank you. Going back to that expense, could you check whether it's in my paperwork as well?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0002\", \"v\": [[\"umm so last month, how many events did I have?\", \"ah, never mind, forget it\", \"oh and um, what wifi stuff have I got in the locker?\"], [\"I'm trying to work out if I've been overdoing it, so last month, how many events did I end up having?\", \"Actually, you know, never mind, it doesn't really matter.\", \"My friend's staying over and wants to get online, so what wifi entries do I have saved in the locker?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0003\", \"v\": [[\"okay so, um, last month, which events did I have?\", \"the galleon one, uh, who else is gonna be there?\", \"different thing, what've I got filed under, um, Energy?\", \"can you star all of them?\"], [\"last month, which events?\", \"galleon one — who else?\", \"stuff under Energy?\", \"star them all\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0004\", \"v\": [[\"I've been meaning to get back into practising, so what have I written in the Didgeridoo notebook so far?\", \"Right, and while we're at it, what about Work?\"], [\"whats in my Didgeridoo notebook\", \"and Work?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0005\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please move the Akira task to thursday?\", \"Sorry, that was the wrong task, I meant the ask lirdoel one.\"], [\"move the Akira task to thursday pls\", \"no wait wrong one, i meant the ask lirdoel one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w34-0006\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what time the opal thing is, please?\", \"Also, could you show me my canasta expenses, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me what it came to?\"], [\"I'm sorting out my week and can't remember the details, so what time 